Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.74,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was this really for the best?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.41,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.39,Default,T,0,0,0,,thank you so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.91,Default,T,0,0,0,,I was so happy...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.34,0:03:52.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,when you returned back safely with the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.91,0:03:57.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, you've thanked me many times already.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.37,0:04:00.53,Default,T,0,0,0,,No, I could never say it enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.33,Default,T,0,0,0,,I really am grateful.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.33,0:04:06.14,Default,T,0,0,0,,When I hurt my leg, you risked your life for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.14,0:04:08.23,Default,T,0,0,0,,To me, you're a hero.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.06,Default,T,0,0,0,,Not just anyone could've done that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.28,0:04:13.31,Default,T,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.31,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.86,0:04:21.33,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This man... He's actually crying.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.66,0:04:28.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone has ever been this grateful to me in my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.72,0:04:33.09,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I'm sure this was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.54,0:04:39.13,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.73,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why was I brought to this island?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.22,Italics,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.05,0:04:57.85,Italics,Dad,0,0,0,,Yukie, are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.72,0:04:59.95,Italics,Dad,0,0,0,,Ryouta?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.11,0:05:11.07,Italics,Dad,0,0,0,,Yukie! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.58,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Hisanobu,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.54,0:05:21.53,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,I've... done the worst thing a \Nparent could ever do.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.73,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,B-But I had no choice...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.37,Overlap,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't talk right now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.63,Overlap,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll go call an ambulance!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.04,0:05:31.64,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,I know you got laid off.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.78,0:05:34.69,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,You didn't want to worry us,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.49,Italics,,0,0,0,,so you just suffered in silence.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.70,0:05:43.02,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,But Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.79,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.49,Italics,S,0,0,0,,You're not even my real dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.95,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Don't try to act like you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.28,Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
