Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.28,0:05:56.07,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hisanobu{-san}.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.23,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ryouta.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.85,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.75,Italics,,0,0,0,,so tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.64,0:06:21.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,A c-corpse?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.78,Default,T,0,0,0,,He's really dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,And he's got no pants.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.47,0:06:36.97,Default,T,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,There could be an enemy at the top of that waterfall.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.54,0:06:46.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.34,0:06:47.84,Default,T,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.07,Default,T,0,0,0,,My leg's still hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.07,0:06:52.45,Default,T,0,0,0,,I can't move that fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.20,0:06:56.60,Default,T,0,0,0,,This time, just leave me here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,don't say something that sad ever again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,There's no way I could leave you behind!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.97,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,I'll go take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.66,Default,T,0,0,0,,You stay here and hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.77,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Two timers.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.77,0:07:28.30,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Two crackers.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.44,0:07:34.30,Italics,T,0,0,0,,And the three implosions and four crackers I took from the kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.24,0:07:38.11,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Probably best not to let Taira know about that yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.79,Italics,T,0,0,0,,There's someone right ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.27,0:07:48.89,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Should I use my radar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.75,Italics,T,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.37,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Then they'd know that I'm here, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.41,Italics,T,0,0,0,,It could be a killer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.51,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I need to get as close as I can and see for myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.62,0:08:06.21,Default,T,0,0,0,,That makes two.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.08,0:08:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.23,Default,T,0,0,0,,I need to hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.23,0:08:12.17,Default,T,0,0,0,,The enemy's close.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.97,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.69,Default,T,0,0,0,,be careful out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.42,0:08:27.47,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Don't throw up...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.47,0:08:28.65,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Don't throw it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.65,0:08:30.37,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Food is scarce.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.53,Italics,,0,0,0,,I need every bit to survive!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.78,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Swallow it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.22,0:08:43.04,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It's only been two days since I arrived on this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.42,0:08:46.55,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I can't believe how much I've changed in that time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.54,0:08:52.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,And that corpse's chip is gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.52,0:08:57.47,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Whoever killed him is playing the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.55,0:09:01.75,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No choice... I'll use my radar!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.48,0:09:09.81,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.56,0:09:14.47,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It must be someone evil, who's killed untold people.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.50,0:09:21.49,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.23,Italics,,0,0,0,,We met at the waterfall!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.52,0:09:26.53,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Did{\i0} she{\i1} kill him?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.09,Default,H,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.74,0:09:42.67,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A BIM?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.47,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.86,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Could that be a corrosive gas type?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.75,Italics,S,0,0,0,,In the game, the gas melts you on contact.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.96,0:10:11.08,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This isn't good!{TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.94,0:10:26.37,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She lured me out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.06,0:10:32.23,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She has so many BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.77,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Three... Four players' worth?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.93,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Did she take them from other players she's killed?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.90,0:10:41.99,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She looks like a teenage girl, but she must be brutal.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.03,0:10:45.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.76,0:10:48.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,nor do I have any intentions of participating in this game.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.03,0:10:50.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,I just want to get off this island alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please put away your BIM, and listen to what I've got to say!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.80,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is she the type who'd listen?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.76,0:11:07.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,The bad guys are Tyrannos Japan, the people who made the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.93,0:11:11.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's stupid to kill each other just because they want us to!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.62,0:11:15.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Won't you help me, so we can both get off this island?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you're not interested, I'll just leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.00,0:11:37.77,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I-I guess I convinced her to relax.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.99,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.98,0:11:52.68,Default,D,0,0,0,,You tried to get me to drop my guard so you could get close
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.04,0:11:54.75,Default,D,0,0,0,,and do something awful!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.17,Default,D,0,0,0,,Men...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.41,Default,D,0,0,0,,Men...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,All men are my enemies!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.90,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She's got a terrible throw.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.94,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was that meant to be aimed at me?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.54,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But she really did want to kill me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.77,0:12:35.82,Italics,S,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.54,Italics,H,0,0,0,,He's too close!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.71,0:12:52.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,A stun gun?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.67,0:13:04.82,Default,H,0,0,0,,Blue eyes...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.78,Default,H,0,0,0,,Blonde hair...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.60,Default,H,0,0,0,,Are you a foreigner?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.24,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can not speak—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.30,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't insult me!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.30,0:13:16.76,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm Japanese.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.99,Default,H,0,0,0,,I just can't trust men!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.99,0:13:21.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,Didn't you attack me, too?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,You attacked me—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.68,0:13:25.08,Default,H,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.62,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.31,0:13:50.00,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It knocked her out?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.85,0:13:56.48,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.49,0:13:59.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.07,0:14:00.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.95,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.89,0:14:10.87,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But this girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.99,0:14:16.50,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She smells so nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.29,0:14:24.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, get it together.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.16,0:14:25.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,I said, wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.07,0:14:32.48,Italics,H,0,0,0,,All men are my enemies!{12:01}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.84,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I don't want her going nuts again.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.49,0:14:39.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I should take away her weapons.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.83,0:14:49.94,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm pulling her panties off.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.25,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.81,0:14:58.85,Italics,,0,0,0,,if I really did,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.84,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I bet she wouldn't notice.{Raep time}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.18,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.80,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There's no one around.{Sakamoto wa ecchi}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.51,0:15:32.32,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.32,0:15:33.83,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.12,0:15:36.76,Italics,T,0,0,0,,And he's got no pants.{6:33}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.76,0:15:38.26,Italics,T,0,0,0,,What's going on?{6:34}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.71,0:15:43.01,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Oh! Here on the island, this girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She was attacked by that man.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.61,0:15:54.81,Italics,,0,0,0,,I want... I want... I want you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.43,0:16:08.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,You got hit with your own stun gun.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.11,0:16:18.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,You'll be too numb to move for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.65,0:16:20.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.94,0:16:23.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.89,0:16:25.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll take you somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A timer BIM?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.38,0:16:36.89,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She had one hidden?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't do it! Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.27,0:16:43.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,I won't let you... rape me...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.99,0:16:50.90,Italics,H,0,0,0,,All guys are just animals!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.55,0:16:54.87,Italics,H,0,0,0,,If I'm going to wind up raped and then murdered,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.45,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'd rather just kill myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.05,0:16:59.92,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Die while I'm still pure...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.71,0:17:05.78,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I've got nowhere to go back to, anyway!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.22,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I don't care if I die.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.02,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.34,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.70,Italics,,0,0,0,,She really was going to kill herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.08,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It wasn't a bluff.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.95,0:17:48.20,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Just now, she actually was going to throw away her life.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.32,Default,T,0,0,0,,Drink up.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.32,0:18:00.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,It's warm coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.44,0:18:05.44,Default,T,0,0,0,,We've got no cups; what else could I use?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.77,0:18:08.02,Default,T,0,0,0,,It's as good a cup as any.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.02,0:18:10.72,Default,T,0,0,0,,I washed it out, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.72,0:18:11.20,Default,T,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.71,0:18:27.32,Default,T,0,0,0,,You must've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.32,0:18:29.16,Default,T,0,0,0,,But worry no more!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.16,0:18:31.60,Default,T,0,0,0,,You've got us with you now!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.15,0:18:36.02,Default,T,0,0,0,,We won't do anything weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.02,0:18:37.72,Default,T,0,0,0,,I promise! Scouts honor!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.15,0:18:43.74,Default,T,0,0,0,,I decided that I'd make it off this island on my own, without playing the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.74,0:18:47.46,Default,T,0,0,0,,So, if you could, I'd really like you to help us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.46,0:18:48.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,Let's escape together.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.73,0:18:52.56,Default,T,0,0,0,,Thankfully, we've got enough food to last a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.74,Default,T,0,0,0,,Lots of bombs, too. So there's nothing to be afraid of. {condense it into one line?}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.51,0:18:57.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.90,Default,H,0,0,0,,Even if we get back,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.90,0:19:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no guarantee anything will be waiting for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.47,0:19:17.76,Default,H,0,0,0,,People who knew each of us well picked us to be sent here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.41,0:19:22.76,Default,H,0,0,0,,They selected us as someone they wanted to disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.71,0:19:27.72,Default,H,0,0,0,,So even if we went back to those people, what then?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.24,0:19:32.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,You mean our friends and families have abandoned us?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.93,Default,T,0,0,0,,I can't believe that!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.93,0:19:39.03,Default,T,0,0,0,,I have a great relationship with my family.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.03,0:19:43.22,Default,T,0,0,0,,They wouldn't want me to disappear!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.22,0:19:46.60,Default,H,0,0,0,,I just meant that they're people we know.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.55,0:19:50.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,Recently, have you done anything to someone that would make them hate you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.01,0:19:53.55,Default,T,0,0,0,,C-Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.33,0:19:57.08,Default,T,0,0,0,,I got in a big fight with a customer last month.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,How do you know about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.40,0:20:02.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,We weren't told anything about this!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.43,0:20:04.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,Where did you hear it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.39,0:20:09.16,Default,H,0,0,0,,They told me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.37,0:20:18.90,Italics,M,0,0,0,,We all picked you.{Same scene as in ep2, but it's a new line}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.49,0:20:22.98,Italics,M,0,0,0,,I hope you disappear!{from ep2}{Here CR had "We all hope you disappear!", but in ep2 it was "I hope you disappear!". I've changed it to match ep2 for consistency as I think(and I could be wrong) the line means something like 'It would be fine if you just disappeared!'.}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.21,0:20:34.52,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Someone picked us to disappear?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.33,0:20:37.80,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Then, that would go for everyone on this island?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.89,0:20:40.30,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Taira?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.80,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That kid?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.23,0:20:43.10,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Me, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.83,0:20:45.06,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Someone chose me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.02,0:20:50.98,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.53,0:20:52.66,Italics,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.08,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.98,Italics,S,0,0,0,,My mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.03,0:21:05.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.49,0:21:08.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.31,0:21:11.63,Default,T,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.63,0:21:13.76,Default,T,0,0,0,,You can't say that!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.76,0:21:14.50,Default,T,0,0,0,,You've got to live!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.05,0:21:17.63,Default,T,0,0,0,,We need to survive and escape this island...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.04,Default,T,0,0,0,,to get back home!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.14,Default,T,0,0,0,,Once we're back, we can work things out!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.77,0:21:23.40,Default,T,0,0,0,,We can't give up!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.67,0:21:30.78,Default,T,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.87,0:21:34.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,There's something out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.42,0:21:36.30,Default,T,0,0,0,,I-Is someone nearby?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.61,0:21:40.11,Default,T,0,0,0,,I heard something!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.59,0:21:44.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.87,0:21:48.64,Default,T,0,0,0,,But I can hear something getting closer.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,Radar canceling?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.86,0:21:50.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,Wh-What are those?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.77,0:22:04.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,They aren't human...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.21,0:22:05.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,Panthers?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wolves?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.53,0:22:08.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,There should've been a radar response!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.84,Overlap,T,0,0,0,,Fire! More fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,Get away from the forest!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.57,0:22:13.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.14,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.14,0:22:16.48,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That hit from the stun gun!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come on! Stand up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.20,0:22:27.95,Default,T,0,0,0,,Th-These things are...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.87,0:22:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,giant lizards!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.37,0:22:33.96,Italics,S,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.57,0:22:57.01,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}We lost each other that day
